  "description": "<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); line-height: 1.75rem; font-family: var(--font-fk-grotesk); white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\">Brand Introduction</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; margin: 0px; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); font-family: fkGroteskNeue, 'fkGroteskNeue Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"my-0\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-weight: 550; color: var(--tw-prose-bold); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\">Splitdyboat</strong>&nbsp;is a tour company passionate about showcasing Hong Kong's natural beauty. They offer a unique platform that allows travelers to share the cost of speedboat tours, making these experiences more accessible and affordable.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); line-height: 1.75rem; font-family: var(--font-fk-grotesk); white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\">Product Description</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; margin: 0px; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); font-family: fkGroteskNeue, 'fkGroteskNeue Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"my-0\">The&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-weight: 550; color: var(--tw-prose-bold); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\">Geopark Four Sea Arches Volcano Sightseeing Tour</strong>&nbsp;is a highlight of Splitdyboat's offerings. This tour takes visitors through the stunning volcanic landscapes of Hong Kong's UNESCO Global Geopark, featuring the world's largest hexagonal volcanic rock columns and the four largest sea arches. The tour provides an immersive experience, blending natural wonders with thrilling speedboat rides.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); line-height: 1.75rem; font-family: var(--font-fk-grotesk); white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; margin: 0px; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); font-family: fkGroteskNeue, 'fkGroteskNeue Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"my-0\">Splitdyboat's unique selling point is its innovative pairing service, which allows solo travelers or small groups to share the cost of speedboat tours, making these adventures more affordable and accessible. Additionally, their tours offer a blend of natural beauty exploration and cultural insights, providing a comprehensive experience of Hong Kong's diverse landscapes.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); line-height: 1.75rem; font-family: var(--font-fk-grotesk); white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\">Payment Terms</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; margin: 0px; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); font-family: fkGroteskNeue, 'fkGroteskNeue Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"my-0\">We offer a variety of payment options to accommodate different customer needs. For exact payment details, it's best to use bank transfer or contact our customer service team.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681); line-height: 1.75rem; font-family: var(--font-fk-grotesk); white-space: normal; background-color: oklch(0.99 0.004 106.471); border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\">Other Information</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: auto; scrollbar-width: auto; list-style-type: disc; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; padding-inline-start: 1.625em; color: oklch(0.304 0.04 21